    "intro_html":  "An old-school Italian countryside pasta: strips of pork tenderloin, bacon, and mushrooms in a buttery cream sauce over ribbon noodles. Each bowl is 788 calories with \u003cstrong\u003e28 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$2.71\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost), and it still eats like a restaurant-style plate for meal prep money.",
